    "3辺の合計が160 cmを超え250 cm以内です。特大荷物スペースつき座席など、対応する座席の予約が必要です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The three sides total over 160 cm and up to 250 cm. Reserve an eligible oversized baggage seat or space."
